\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Supervised rule evolution in SCP Workbench{}. A layered presentation inspired by WikiSkill\nonbreakingspace \citep  {tang2026wikiskill} separates recorded evidence, cases and decisions, and candidate guidance. The four stages apply a candidate, interpret prior experience, propose a revision, and evaluate it under review. Updates retain the preceding rule and supporting records. Further attempts require current approval and remaining allowance. Acceptance concerns the reviewed task scope; candidate rules require independent tests before publication for reuse. Section\nonbreakingspace \ref  {sec:handoff} explains the stages; Figure\nonbreakingspace \ref  {fig:evolution} gives a concrete rule history.\relax }}{8}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:handoff}{{4}{8}{Supervised rule evolution in \workbench {}. A layered presentation inspired by WikiSkill~\cite {tang2026wikiskill} separates recorded evidence, cases and decisions, and candidate guidance. The four stages apply a candidate, interpret prior experience, propose a revision, and evaluate it under review. Updates retain the preceding rule and supporting records. Further attempts require current approval and remaining allowance. Acceptance concerns the reviewed task scope; candidate rules require independent tests before publication for reuse. Section~\ref {sec:handoff} explains the stages; Figure~\ref {fig:evolution} gives a concrete rule history.\relax }{figure.caption.6}{}}
