\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces A heater reference case becomes a source of candidate guidance\nonbreakingspace \citep  {scpCheckpoint}. Steps 1--2 expose conflicting guarantees in the contract fragment. Step 3 records review of an added ordering assumption and the checks required afterwards. Step 4 shows selected rule revisions with links to sources and checks; drafts 1, 2, and 4 are selected from the archive. The added assumption was approved, while the candidate rules await qualification. Horizontal arrows show revision order; intermediate and later drafts are omitted.\relax }}{9}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:evolution}{{5}{9}{A heater reference case becomes a source of candidate guidance~\cite {scpCheckpoint}. Steps 1--2 expose conflicting guarantees in the contract fragment. Step 3 records review of an added ordering assumption and the checks required afterwards. Step 4 shows selected rule revisions with links to sources and checks; drafts 1, 2, and 4 are selected from the archive. The added assumption was approved, while the candidate rules await qualification. Horizontal arrows show revision order; intermediate and later drafts are omitted.\relax }{figure.caption.7}{}}
